  "description": "Perfect for young riders aged 5–8, the Pinnacle Ash 20 Bike Junior is designed to build confidence while delivering a fun and capable ride across parks, paths, and light trails. The strong steel frame provides durability for everyday adventures, while the 30mm suspension fork helps absorb bumps and uneven surfaces for a smoother, more comfortable experience.\n\nThe 6-speed twist-shift gearing offers simple, intuitive control, making it easy for kids to adapt to different terrain as they learn and progress. Reliable V-brakes deliver consistent stopping power, while sturdy 20\" wheels and grippy tyres ensure stability and control on varied surfaces. With its balanced mix of comfort, durability, and ease of use, this bike is a great introduction to off-road riding for younger cyclists.",
